AUDIO LICENSING

The audio in assets/audio/ is NOT covered by the MIT grant above. It consists
of public-domain classical recordings, redistributed unmodified in derivation
from public sources. See AUDIO-LICENSING.md for per-track provenance, source
URL, and licence. The compositions are long out of copyright; the recordings
are public-domain or CC0 transfers.

The bundled loops are derived works, produced by the project's own analysis
pipeline (equal-power crossfade, static gain to -24 LUFS, tanh peak knee). The
derivation is documented in the design notes and is reproducible from the
recorded source URLs and sha256 sums.
